      <div class="card stack stack-3">
        <span class="feature-num">01</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Verify any reference</h3>
        <p class="muted small">
          Legacy CBE receipts, the new token-based CBE links, Telebirr receipt numbers, Dashen, Abyssinia,
          CBE Birr and M-Pesa — all through one endpoint.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card stack stack-3">
        <span class="feature-num">02</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Read receipt images</h3>
