          When a buyer sends a screenshot instead of a reference, post the image and get the payment details
          extracted from it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card stack stack-3">
        <span class="feature-num">03</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Consistent responses</h3>
        <p class="muted small">
          Every provider returns the same shape — payer, receiver, amount, date and reference — so your
          checkout code stays the same as you add banks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card stack stack-3">
        <span class="feature-num">04</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Usage you can see</h3>
        <p class="muted small">
          The dashboard shows every request, its status and how long it took, so a failing integration is
          obvious rather than mysterious.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card stack stack-3">
        <span class="feature-num">05</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Keys you control</h3>
        <p class="muted small">
          Issue a key per environment and revoke any of them instantly. Keys are stored hashed and shown
